            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "The case concerns whether a private plaintiff can obtain punitive damages against municipal government defendants under Section\u202f504 of the Rehabilitation Act and Title\u202fII of the Americans with Disabilities Act."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Robbins",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "12cc86e3b7db2203e8d3658d86db0b845acfee191f034ff4e8a410725ff50470",
            "evidence_ids": [
