            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 16,
              "start": 16
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to United States, as amicus curiae (Gregory G. Garre), according to United States, as amicus curiae (Gregory G. Garre), the statutes do not sanction punitive damages, which exceed what is necessary to make good a wrong."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Court",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "12cc86e3b7db2203e8d3658d86db0b845acfee191f034ff4e8a410725ff50470",
